# A sequence whose bytes arrive in parts acts once its last byte
# arrives. An ESC inside a control sequence starts a new sequence, and an
# OSC string ends at its BEL even when its parts arrive apart.
# spec: vt100.net's DEC parser
size 10 4
send "a\e[1"
send ";31mb\e"
send "[0mc\e]2;ti"
send "tle\a"
send "\e[2;\e[3;4Hd"
dump state
send "\e[1;31\e]2;x\ae"
send "\e]2;y\e[1mf\e[m"
dump state
